      "text": "Demand is made upon you under the Authority vested in the Department of Health by Chapter 22 of the Administrative Code of The City of New York for payment of all the rent you now owe by check or money order (not cash) made out to: DEPARTMENT OF HEALTH\nSend your check or money order with the enclosed notice. A RECEIPT WILL BE SENT YOU.",
